Map data license
================

Map data derived from OpenStreetMap, whether in this directory or attached
to the `assets-*` GitHub releases of this repository (OSM extracts such as
`*.osm.pbf`, imported networks such as `*.rhnet`), is

    © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
    Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.

    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

This data is not covered by the GPL-3.0 license of the Rust Hour source code
(see ../LICENSE). If you publicly use or redistribute it, or a database
derived from it, you must keep this attribution and offer any derived
database under the ODbL.
